{"id":"76620ef262e6519d","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-T-schema-equivalence.md","title":"基础语言T-schema就是去引号公理集","display":"prop-T-schema-equivalence — 基础语言T-schema就是去引号公理集","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-T-schema-equivalence","aliases":["91-prop-T-schema-equivalence"],"display":"prop-T-schema-equivalence — 基础语言T-schema就是去引号公理集","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-disquotational-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-T-schema-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-T-schema-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-T-schema-equivalence — 基础语言T-schema就是去引号公理集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7857c7bf0771011b\" href=\"?note=7857c7bf0771011b\" title=\"91-df-disquotational-truth\">91-df-disquotational-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-T-schema-equivalence-—-基础语言-T-schema-就是去引号公理集\">prop-T-schema-equivalence — 基础语言 T-schema 就是去引号公理集</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\)</span>\n(基础语言 T-schema 实例集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DisqTruth}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{DisqTruth}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>\n(基础语言去引号实例集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7857c7bf0771011b\" href=\"?note=7857c7bf0771011b\" title=\"91-df-disquotational-truth\">91-df-disquotational-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\mathrm{DisqTruth}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n=\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\mathrm{DisqTruth}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n=\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>“T-schema”与“去引号公理”在这里是同一组基础语言公式的两种名称。\n真正需要固定的是实例域：TB 取基础闭句，UTB 使用基础公式的统一参数模式，\n分层理论则只为更低层语言给每一级真理谓词配置双条件实例。</p>\n<p>若把实例域改成含该真理谓词的全部自指句，所得公理集已是另一个理论，\n在经典逻辑下会遇到说谎者矛盾。因此形式同名不表示不同实例域上的理论\n等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-T-schema-equivalence-—-基础语言-T-schema-就是去引号公理集","text":"prop-T-schema-equivalence — 基础语言 T-schema 就是去引号公理集","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-disquotational-truth","status":"resolved","id":"7857c7bf0771011b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-disquotational-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)$\n(基础语言 T-schema 实例集, see [[91-df-T-schema]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-disquotational-truth","status":"resolved","id":"7857c7bf0771011b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DisqTruth}_{\\mathcal L_0}$\n(基础语言去引号实例集, see [[91-df-disquotational-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DisqTruth}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TSch}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\n=\n\\mathrm{DisqTruth}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n=\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1450,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-T-schema-equivalence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-T-schema-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["ba367ff1b4bb3da3","7857c7bf0771011b"]}